  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The fire recognizes you as its own and burns you not.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Flame Heart<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your fire resistance increases to 10, and when you are affected by a fire effect you can expend one use of mythic power to gain fire resistance of 5 times your mythic tier until the end of your next turn. When casting fire spells with the fire descriptor or throwing alchemist bombs that deal fire damage, treat your caster level or alchemist level as though it was 1 higher; this stacks with the increase from Flame Heart.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc154\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
